<title>HONG KONG: HK Christmas tree maker seen in IPO soon - sources.</title>
<headline>HK Christmas tree maker seen in IPO soon - sources.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong-based artificial Christmas tree manufacturer FT Holdings Ltd is expected to hold a listing presentation for analysts on December 16, market sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>Initial public offering of shares is expected to kick off later in December and dealing in the company's shares is expected to begin in late December or early January, they said.</p>
<p>Market sources said CEF Capital and Tai Fook Securities are expected to be the underwriters of the issue but no further listing details were immediately available to the market.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
